    {
      "id": "claim_bc6c4e37383a4039b54d4275c1fbdd00",
      "statement": "reminder_delivery is deterministic: it revalidates the active reminder, configured thread, and wake token against the store before emitting one data envelope in an AI message, yields no reminder content on missing or invalid state, and never includes the wake token in the generated card.",
