    {
      "id": "claim_5d7bfb5a4893412595a4d38da198ab7e",
      "statement": "coach_agent() is the fallthrough destination for ordinary turns and invokes a checkpointer-free LangChain create_agent with only safe-projected messages; it derives AgentContext(user_id, thread_id, human_msg_id) server-side from authenticated configuration, assigning a human-message id if absent, so client-supplied identifiers cannot establish this scope.",
      "evidence": [
