      "statement": "relay_question's assembled answer is monograph-prefixed with optional follow-up bullets for a normal validated result; a child safety short circuit is returned byte-for-byte with no framing or follow-ups; and a child exception or missing answer becomes the fixed RELAY_ERROR_MESSAGE rather than the raw exception.",
