      "statement": "tests/agent/test_route_b.py's test_composition_requires_same_turn_resolved_fact_refs pins the same-turn invariant end to end: a composition whose DataRef targets match the current scope and envelope is valid, the identical tree is rejected when validated against a different turn_scope_id, and it is rejected again when the envelope's underlying value no longer matches what the ref pointer resolves to.",
